    {
      "title": "[Demo Update] UI redesign, engine change, voice acting implementation",
      "date": "2024-05-27 07:30:25",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/5741605105621577094",
      "content": "After three years, for the update of the demo version, there is no additional viewable story content.\n\n- Optimized the UI and engine\n- Implemented voice acting for the three main heroines and some other characters\n- Proofread the text, correcting typos and non-standard punctuation usage, and revising some awkward phrasing\n- Changed some backgrounds, added one new CG that can be publicly released",
      "key": "1389900::fa2caf3e286e099edf18fa1cee1b487f7f0588d9",
      "tags": [
        {
          "feature": "- Optimized the UI and engine"
        },
        {
          "feature": "- Implemented voice acting for the three main heroines and some other characters"
        },
        {
          "bug": "- Proofread the text, correcting typos and non-standard punctuation usage, and revising some awkward phrasing"
        },
        {
          "feature": "- Changed some backgrounds, added one new CG that can be publicly released"
        }
      ]
    },
